---
description: Data contract for the Jira snapshot
globs: src/data/schema.ts,docs/DATA_CONTRACT.md
alwaysApply: false
---

Do not change `src/data/schema.ts` without bumping `schemaVersion` and updating `docs/DATA_CONTRACT.md` and `docs/snapshot.schema.json` (`npm run schema:export`). Versions 1 and 2 both parse. Unknown JSON fields are ignored. A breaking change is any rename, removal, or tighter requirement.
